<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Play Games Services resource ids (Play Console project 537830905161).

  Values come from Play Console: Play Games Services -> Achievements/Leaderboards -> "Get resources".
  NOTE: that export derives resource names from the display names (achievement_quick,
  leaderboard_best_average_10_taps, app_id, ...). Do NOT paste it over this file wholesale; copy
  the ids into the names below, which is what AchievementIds / PlayGamesManager / the manifest use.

  An EMPTY game_services_project_id means "Play Games is not configured":
  PlayGamesManager.isConfigured is then false and every Play Games call is a no-op.
  Individual leaderboard/achievement ids that are empty are skipped the same way.
-->
